{"id":"t6-hafazan","tahap":"T6","nama":"Hafazan (KAFA)","sk":"Hafazan","ikon":"📖","warna":"#7A5AB8","bahasa":"ms","kur":"KAFA Tahun 6 (melengkapkan Juz 'Amma)","semak":"pending ustaz review","jawi":true,"versi":"0.5.68","sumber":"Year 6 hafazan surahs (the owner's e-book is pictures only); Quran text from the app's KFGQPC Uthmani data; meanings pending an ustaz's review; shown in full Jawi.","topik":[{"id":"t6-hafazan-1","nama":"Surah 'Abasa","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-80 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai empat puluh dua ayat (42 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Bermasam muka"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah 'Abasa"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَبَسَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَن جَآءَهُ ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا يُدْرِيكَ لَعَلَّهُۥ يَزَّكَّىٰٓ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَوْ يَذَّكَّرُ فَتَنفَعَهُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰٓ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَمَّا مَنِ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَنتَ لَهُۥ تَصَدَّىٰ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَمَا عَلَيْكَ أَلَّا يَزَّكَّىٰ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَمَّا مَن جَآءَكَ يَسْعَىٰ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَهُوَ يَخْشَىٰ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَنتَ عَنْهُ تَلَهَّىٰ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّآ إِنَّهَا تَذْكِرَةٌ</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَمَن شَآءَ ذَكَرَهُۥ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِى صُحُفٍ مُّكَرَّمَةٍ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مَّرْفُوعَةٍ مُّطَهَّرَةِۭ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">بِأَيْدِى سَفَرَةٍ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كِرَامِۭ بَرَرَةٍ</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قُتِلَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَآ أَكْفَرَهُۥ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مِنْ أَىِّ شَىْءٍ خَلَقَهُۥ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مِن نُّطْفَةٍ خَلَقَهُۥ فَقَدَّرَهُۥ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ ٱلسَّبِيلَ يَسَّرَهُۥ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ أَمَاتَهُۥ فَأَقْبَرَهُۥ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ إِذَا شَآءَ أَنشَرَهُۥ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا لَمَّا يَقْضِ مَآ أَمَرَهُۥ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ إِلَىٰ طَعَامِهِۦٓ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَنَّا صَبَبْنَا ٱلْمَآءَ صَبًّا</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ شَقَقْنَا ٱلْأَرْضَ شَقًّا</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا حَبًّا</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَعِنَبًا وَقَضْبًا</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَزَيْتُونًا وَنَخْلاً</span> (29)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَحَدَآئِقَ غُلْبًا</span> (30)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَفَـٰكِهَةً وَأَبًّا</span> (31)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مَّتَـٰعًا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَـٰمِكُمْ</span> (32)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلصَّآخَّةُ</span> (33)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ يَفِرُّ ٱلْمَرْءُ مِنْ أَخِيهِ</span> (34)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأُمِّهِۦ وَأَبِيهِ</span> (35)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَصَـٰحِبَتِهِۦ وَبَنِيهِ</span> (36)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِكُلِّ ٱمْرِىٍٕ مِّنْهُمْ يَوْمَئِذٍ شَأْنٌ يُغْنِيهِ</span> (37)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ مُّسْفِرَةٌ</span> (38)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ضَاحِكَةٌ مُّسْتَبْشِرَةٌ</span> (39)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَوُجُوهٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ عَلَيْهَا غَبَرَةٌ</span> (40)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">تَرْهَقُهَا قَتَرَةٌ</span> (41)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْكَفَرَةُ ٱلْفَجَرَةُ</span> (42)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Nabi Muhammad SAW bermasam muka ketika seorang buta, Abdullah bin Ummi Maktum, datang bertanya ketika baginda sedang berdakwah kepada pembesar Quraisy. Allah menegur baginda. Al-Quran ialah peringatan yang mulia. Pada hari kiamat setiap orang lari daripada saudara, ibu bapa, isteri dan anaknya."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita melayan semua orang dengan adil tanpa mengira kedudukan","Kita bersyukur dengan makanan yang Allah tumbuhkan","Pada hari kiamat setiap orang sibuk dengan dirinya"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["'Abasa","Maksudnya: Bermasam muka."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-2","nama":"Surah An-Nazi'at","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-79 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai empat puluh enam ayat (46 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah An-Nazi'at"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰزِعَـٰتِ غَرْقًا</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلنَّـٰشِطَـٰتِ نَشْطًا</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلسَّـٰبِحَـٰتِ سَبْحًا</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَٱلسَّـٰبِقَـٰتِ سَبْقًا</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَٱلْمُدَبِّرَٰتِ أَمْرًا</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ تَرْجُفُ ٱلرَّاجِفَةُ</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">تَتْبَعُهَا ٱلرَّادِفَةُ</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قُلُوبٌ يَوْمَئِذٍ وَاجِفَةٌ</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَبْصَـٰرُهَا خَـٰشِعَةٌ</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَقُولُونَ أَءِنَّا لَمَرْدُودُونَ فِى ٱلْحَافِرَةِ</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَءِذَا كُنَّا عِظَـٰمًا نَّخِرَةً</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">قَالُواْ تِلْكَ إِذًا كَرَّةٌ خَاسِرَةٌ</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِنَّمَا هِىَ زَجْرَةٌ وَٰحِدَةٌ</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِذَا هُم بِٱلسَّاهِرَةِ</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">هَلْ أَتَـٰكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰٓ</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِذْ نَادَٮٰهُ رَبُّهُۥ بِٱلْوَادِ ٱلْمُقَدَّسِ طُوًى</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱذْهَبْ إِلَىٰ فِرْعَوْنَ إِنَّهُۥ طَغَىٰ</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَقُلْ هَل لَّكَ إِلَىٰٓ أَن تَزَكَّىٰ</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَهْدِيَكَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ فَتَخْشَىٰ</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَرَٮٰهُ ٱلْأَيَةَ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَكَذَّبَ وَعَصَىٰ</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ أَدْبَرَ يَسْعَىٰ</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَحَشَرَ فَنَادَىٰ</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَقَالَ أَنَا رَبُّكُمُ ٱلْأَعْلَىٰ</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَخَذَهُ ٱللَّهُ نَكَالَ ٱلْأَخِرَةِ وَٱلْأُولَىٰٓ</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَعِبْرَةً لِّمَن يَخْشَىٰٓ</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ءَأَنتُمْ أَشَدُّ خَلْقًا أَمِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ‌ۚ بَنَـٰهَا</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">رَفَعَ سَمْكَهَا فَسَوَّٮٰهَا</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَغْطَشَ لَيْلَهَا وَأَخْرَجَ ضُحَـٰهَا</span> (29)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْأَرْضَ بَعْدَ ذَٰلِكَ دَحَـٰهَآ</span> (30)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَخْرَجَ مِنْهَا مَآءَهَا وَمَرْعَـٰهَا</span> (31)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَرْسَـٰهَا</span> (32)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">مَتَـٰعًا لَّكُمْ وَلِأَنْعَـٰمِكُمْ</span> (33)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِذَا جَآءَتِ ٱلطَّآمَّةُ ٱلْكُبْرَىٰ</span> (34)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ يَتَذَكَّرُ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنُ مَا سَعَىٰ</span> (35)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَبُرِّزَتِ ٱلْجَحِيمُ لِمَن يَرَىٰ</span> (36)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَأَمَّا مَن طَغَىٰ</span> (37)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَءَاثَرَ ٱلْحَيَوٰةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا</span> (38)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَحِيمَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ</span> (39)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَافَ مَقَامَ رَبِّهِۦ وَنَهَى ٱلنَّفْسَ عَنِ ٱلْهَوَىٰ</span> (40)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَإِنَّ ٱلْجَنَّةَ هِىَ ٱلْمَأْوَىٰ</span> (41)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَسْــَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلسَّاعَةِ أَيَّانَ مُرْسَـٰهَا</span> (42)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَٮٰهَآ</span> (43)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَـٰهَآ</span> (44)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَـٰهَا</span> (45)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَأَنَّهُمْ يَوْمَ يَرَوْنَهَا لَمْ يَلْبَثُوٓاْ إِلَّا عَشِيَّةً أَوْ ضُحَـٰهَا</span> (46)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Allah bersumpah dengan malaikat yang mencabut nyawa. Kisah Nabi Musa dan Firaun yang mengaku menjadi tuhan, lalu dibinasakan. Orang yang takut kepada Allah dan menahan nafsu, syurga tempat tinggalnya."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita takut kepada Allah dan menahan hawa nafsu","Orang yang sombong seperti Firaun akan dibinasakan","Hanya Allah yang mengetahui bila kiamat berlaku"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["An-Nazi'at","Maksudnya: Malaikat yang mencabut nyawa."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-3","nama":"Surah An-Naba'","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Tentang surah ini"},{"j":"l","t":["Surah ke-78 dalam al-Quran","Mempunyai empat puluh ayat (40 ayat)","Surah Makkiyyah","Maksud nama: Berita besar"]},{"j":"h","t":"Bacaan Surah An-Naba'"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَمَّ يَتَسَآءَلُونَ</span> (1)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">عَنِ ٱلنَّبَإِ ٱلْعَظِيمِ</span> (2)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ٱلَّذِى هُمْ فِيهِ مُخْتَلِفُونَ</span> (3)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ</span> (4)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ثُمَّ كَلَّا سَيَعْلَمُونَ</span> (5)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">أَلَمْ نَجْعَلِ ٱلْأَرْضَ مِهَـٰدًا</span> (6)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَٱلْجِبَالَ أَوْتَادًا</span> (7)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَخَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ أَزْوَٰجًا</span> (8)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَعَلْنَا نَوْمَكُمْ سُبَاتًا</span> (9)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلَّيْلَ لِبَاسًا</span> (10)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَعَلْنَا ٱلنَّهَارَ مَعَاشًا</span> (11)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَبَنَيْنَا فَوْقَكُمْ سَبْعًا شِدَادًا</span> (12)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَعَلْنَا سِرَاجًا وَهَّاجًا</span> (13)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَأَنزَلْنَا مِنَ ٱلْمُعْصِرَٰتِ مَآءً ثَجَّاجًا</span> (14)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِّنُخْرِجَ بِهِۦ حَبًّا وَنَبَاتًا</span> (15)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَجَنَّـٰتٍ أَلْفَافًا</span> (16)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ يَوْمَ ٱلْفَصْلِ كَانَ مِيقَـٰتًا</span> (17)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ يُنفَخُ فِى ٱلصُّورِ فَتَأْتُونَ أَفْوَاجًا</span> (18)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَفُتِحَتِ ٱلسَّمَآءُ فَكَانَتْ أَبْوَٰبًا</span> (19)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَسُيِّرَتِ ٱلْجِبَالُ فَكَانَتْ سَرَابًا</span> (20)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ جَهَنَّمَ كَانَتْ مِرْصَادًا</span> (21)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لِّلطَّـٰغِينَ مَـَٔـابًا</span> (22)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّـٰبِثِينَ فِيهَآ أَحْقَابًا</span> (23)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّا يَذُوقُونَ فِيهَا بَرْدًا وَلَا شَرَابًا</span> (24)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِلَّا حَمِيمًا وَغَسَّاقًا</span> (25)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">جَزَآءً وِفَاقًا</span> (26)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّهُمْ كَانُواْ لَا يَرْجُونَ حِسَابًا</span> (27)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَكَذَّبُواْ بِـَٔـايَـٰتِنَا كِذَّابًا</span> (28)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَكُلَّ شَىْءٍ أَحْصَيْنَـٰهُ كِتَـٰبًا</span> (29)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">فَذُوقُواْ فَلَن نَّزِيدَكُمْ إِلَّا عَذَابًا</span> (30)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّ لِلْمُتَّقِينَ مَفَازًا</span> (31)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">حَدَآئِقَ وَأَعْنَـٰبًا</span> (32)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَكَوَاعِبَ أَتْرَابًا</span> (33)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">وَكَأْسًا دِهَاقًا</span> (34)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">لَّا يَسْمَعُونَ فِيهَا لَغْوًا وَلَا كِذَّٰبًا</span> (35)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">جَزَآءً مِّن رَّبِّكَ عَطَآءً حِسَابًا</span> (36)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">رَّبِّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَا ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ‌ۖ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ مِنْهُ خِطَابًا</span> (37)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">يَوْمَ يَقُومُ ٱلرُّوحُ وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ صَفًّا‌ۖ لَّا يَتَكَلَّمُونَ إِلَّا مَنْ أَذِنَ لَهُ ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنُ وَقَالَ صَوَابًا</span> (38)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْيَوْمُ ٱلْحَقُّ‌ۖ فَمَن شَآءَ ٱتَّخَذَ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِۦ مَـَٔـابًا</span> (39)"},{"j":"p","t":"<span class=\"arab\">إِنَّآ أَنذَرْنَـٰكُمْ عَذَابًا قَرِيبًا يَوْمَ يَنظُرُ ٱلْمَرْءُ مَا قَدَّمَتْ يَدَاهُ وَيَقُولُ ٱلْكَافِرُ يَـٰلَيْتَنِى كُنتُ تُرَٰبَۢا</span> (40)"},{"j":"h","t":"Maksud ringkas"},{"j":"p","t":"Orang kafir bertanya tentang berita besar, iaitu hari kebangkitan. Allah menjadikan bumi sebagai hamparan, gunung sebagai pasak, malam sebagai pakaian dan siang untuk mencari rezeki. Hari keputusan pasti datang; neraka menunggu orang yang melampaui batas dan syurga untuk orang yang bertakwa."},{"j":"h","t":"Pengajaran"},{"j":"l","t":["Kita memerhati ciptaan Allah sebagai tanda kekuasaan-Nya","Hari kebangkitan pasti berlaku","Orang yang bertakwa akan mendapat syurga"]},{"j":"h","t":"Cara menghafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["Dengar bacaan guru atau rakaman","Hafaz dua atau tiga ayat sehari","Ulang ayat yang telah dihafaz sebelum menambah ayat baharu","Baca dalam solat"]}],"glosari":[["An-Naba'","Maksudnya: Berita besar."],["Makkiyyah","Surah yang diturunkan sebelum Nabi Muhammad SAW berhijrah ke Madinah."]]},{"id":"t6-hafazan-4","nama":"Ulang kaji hafazan Tahun 6","nota":[{"j":"h","t":"Surah yang dihafaz"},{"j":"l","t":["'Abasa: 42 ayat","An-Nazi'at: 46 ayat","An-Naba': 40 ayat"]},{"j":"h","t":"Tahniah"},{"j":"p","t":"Dengan tiga surah ini, kita telah menghafaz seluruh Juz 'Amma, iaitu juzuk yang ke-30 dalam al-Quran."}],"glosari":[["Juz 'Amma","Juzuk yang ke-30 dalam al-Quran."],["Juzuk","Bahagian al-Quran; ada 30 juzuk."]]}]}